13. git config core.hookspath=/home/alex/.config/git/hooks -> GLOBAL hooks, every repo
14. post-index-change -> symlink to _chain (all 28 hook names symlink to the same _chain script)
15. _chain is a pre-commit script: runs "git add" in a loop AND "git stash push -k -u" -> both mutate the index -> re-fire post-index-change -> unbounded recursion
16. No recursion guard in _chain (read all 69 lines)
17. No git repo tracking /home/alex/.config/git/hooks -> cannot diff the 14:09 edit
18. git 2.43.0 supports post-index-change (since 2.22) -> symlink is live
